      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        304,
        -448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1200,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## \ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Automated Event e-Ticket Engine with Dynamic QR Codes & Drive Archiving\n\n### Enterprise-grade registration-to-ticket pipeline\nAutomates dynamic QR code generation, Google Doc personalization, high-resolution PDF rendering, cloud archiving, and automated dispatch via Gmail with real-time Google Sheets status synchronization.\n\n**Key Production Features:**\n- **Idempotency Guard:** Prevents duplicate ticket generation or re-dispatch if registration rows are re-evaluated.\n- **Input Validation & Fallback:** Validates attendee email format and automatically creates cryptographic ticket IDs if omitted.\n- **Dynamic QR Code Injection:** Compiles high-density verification QR codes via QuickChart API without external paid subscriptions.\n- **Storage Hygiene:** Automatically purges temporary Google Docs after PDF conversion to prevent Drive storage pollution.\n- **Bidirectional Sync:** Updates Google Sheets with `ISSUED` status, timestamp, and persistent PDF Drive view links."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0da1c7da-153a-4d4e-9d76-1858c4136d9f",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        304,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 604,
        "content": "### \ud83d\udce5 1. Ingestion & Validation\n**Triggers:** Real-time Google Sheets poll or Manual Test trigger.\n**Processing:** Validates RFC 5322 email syntax, normalizes casing, verifies `STATUS` column, and constructs QR verification parameters."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "328f569a-6ad3-47f3-a86d-6381f6f55ff2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        992,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 220,
        "height": 604,
        "content": "### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 2. Idempotency Gate\n**Filter:** Evaluates `is_already_issued` and `is_valid_email`.\n- **True:** Proceeds to ticket generation.\n- **False:** Diverts to Audit Log (skips duplicate processing)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7d6daf42-6d60-404c-906f-203d93a53078",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1232,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 940,
        "height": 604,
        "content": "### \ud83c\udfa8 3. Doc Personalization & PDF Render\n**Actions:**\n1. Duplicates master Google Doc template.\n2. Injects variables (`{{NAMA}}`, `{{EMAIL}}`, `{{TIKET}}`, `{{EVENT}}`, `{{TIER}}`, `{{DATE}}`).\n3. Calls Google Docs API to insert QR code at designated index.\n4. Compiles and downloads personalized document as binary PDF."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d43030ca-ce9d-427a-bcb0-7e2ec28674b0",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2192,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 1000,
        "height": 604,
        "content": "### \ud83d\ude80 4. Archiving, Dispatch & Hygiene\n**Actions:**\n1. Stores PDF in dedicated Drive folder.\n2. Dispatches branded HTML email with PDF attachment via Gmail.\n3. Deletes temporary working Google Doc.\n4. Syncs `ISSUED` status & PDF link back to Google Sheets."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
